# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build output
dist/
build/
docs/*
!docs/readme-assets/
!docs/ai-guidance/
!docs/controlled-terminology.md
!docs/status/
!docs/reviews/

*.md
!README.md
!docs/controlled-terminology.md
!docs/ai-guidance/*.md
!docs/status/*.md
# Review documents are the written record of why the code looks the way it
# does — they are deliverables, not build output. Both `docs/*` and the blanket
# `*.md` above were silently excluding every one of them, so they never entered
# git and never reached the laptop in any shipped archive.
!docs/reviews/*.md
!docs/ai-guidance/reviews/*.md

# Bun
bun.lockb

# Environment
.env
.env.*

# IDE
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# TypeScript
*.tsbuildinfo

# Vite
vite.config.ts.timestamp-*
.vite/

# Test coverage
coverage/

# local review capture harnesses (container-specific)
src/tools/

# GitHub Pages build output + root tooling deps
/_site/
/node_modules/
/package-lock.json

# Probe output (screenshots, run logs) — regenerate with the probes in src/.probe/
src/.probe/out/

# Quarantine for files a sync had to remove. The device mount forbids unlink,
# so deletions are staged here by `mv` instead; nothing in it belongs in git.
_to_delete/
